1
00:00:00,290 --> 00:00:04,140
I was the one who had to break the news
about Hamza to the CIA.

2
00:00:05,040 --> 00:00:08,740
Considering what Dufraisne was planning,
Hamza would have agreed with my decision.

3
00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:12,240
Dufraisne was receiving
five Red Mercury devices.

4
00:00:12,770 --> 00:00:15,620
All of them were going
to be detonated at the same time.

5
00:00:16,250 --> 00:00:18,210
One of them was going
to be on the Okhotsk tanker

6
00:00:18,280 --> 00:00:20,050
to be taken into Los Angeles Harbor.

7
00:00:20,120 --> 00:00:22,210
The second was being choppered
to Nashville,

8
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:24,400
where the President
was making an appearance.

9
00:00:25,250 --> 00:00:27,250
The last three were for New York City.

10
00:00:27,320 --> 00:00:30,810
But first, Emile smuggled
the bombs into the States

11
00:00:30,880 --> 00:00:32,650
through his headquarters in New Orleans.

12
00:00:32,720 --> 00:00:36,500
While I was back there, I managed
to sneak into the restricted area again.

13
00:00:37,540 --> 00:00:39,080
But I'm sure you remember that.
